# 📅 Assignment Due Date Tracker

A smart and simple web application to help students track homework assignments, manage deadlines, and never miss a submission again!


---

## ✨ Features

| Feature | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| ➕ **Add Assignments** | Enter assignment name and select due date |
| ✅ **Mark Complete** | Check off finished assignments |
| 🗑️ **Delete Tasks** | Remove assignments when no longer needed |
| 🎨 **Color-Coded Urgency** | Red (overdue), Yellow (warning), Green (safe) |
| 📊 **Live Statistics** | Shows Total, Pending & Completed counts |
| 🔍 **Filter Tasks** | View All, Pending, or Completed assignments |
| 💾 **Auto-Save** | Saves data to LocalStorage (persists after browser close) |
| 📱 **Responsive Design** | Works perfectly on mobile, tablet & desktop |

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack
📝 HTML5 - Structure
🎨 CSS3 - Styling & Animations
⚡ JavaScript - Functionality
💾 LocalStorage - Data Persistence

📖 How to Use
Step	Action
1	Enter assignment name in the input field
2	Select due date from date picker
3	Click "Add Assignment" button
4	View assignment in the list with color-coded urgency
5	Click "Complete" when finished
6	Click "Delete" to remove assignment
7	Use filter buttons to sort tasks

🎨 Color Guide
Color	Meaning	Days Left
🔴 Red	Overdue / Due Today	0 days or less
🟡 Yellow	Urgent	1-2 days left
🟢 Green	Safe	3+ days left


